{"id":"4e3efc5b364da28f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTermRow.md","title":"FTermRow","display":"FTermRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FTermRow","parameters":["F","f","z1218","z1219","z1220"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FTermRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>f</span><span>z1218</span><span>z1219</span><span>z1220</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>z1218</code>、<code>z1219</code>、<code>z1220</code>。</p>\n<p>有限一阶项；函数元数在固定签名中给定，允许零元函数。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FTermRow F f z1218 z1219 z1220)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z1220 t)\n    (and\n      (@ FTSig F f)\n      (or\n        (exists z1223 (and (@ Nat z1223) (@ FVar z1223 t)))\n        (exists z1224\n          (exists z1225\n            (exists z1226\n              (and\n                (in z1224 F)\n                (and\n                  (@ App f z1224 z1226)\n                  (and\n                    (@ FFun z1224 z1225 t)\n                    (and\n                      (@ Seq z1225 z1226)\n                      (forall z1227\n                        (implies\n                          (in z1227 z1226)\n                          (exists z1228\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1225 z1227 z1228)\n                            (exists z1229 (exists z1230 (and (in z1229 z1219) (and (@ App z1218 z1229 z1230) (= z1230 z1228))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\"ZFC_FFun\">FFun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a2f4391c554ce13\" href=\"?note=9a2f4391c554ce13\" title=\"ZFC_FTSig\">FTSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e67edc6c28bf5962\" href=\"?note=e67edc6c28bf5962\" title=\"ZFC_FVar\">FVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FTermRow F f z1218 z1219 z1220)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFun|FFun]]；[[ZFC_FTSig|FTSig]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFun","status":"resolved","id":"140c6359fed2eb8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFun|FFun]]；[[ZFC_FTSig|FTSig]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Seq|